# ============================================================================
#  MQL5 data folder -- track ONLY the LiquidityRange application.
#
#  Strategy: deny everything at the root, then re-include the three folders
#  that belong to this project. Any other project, generated file, profile,
#  log, compiled binary or terminal artifact stays out of version control.
# ============================================================================

# --- Deny everything at the repository root --------------------------------
/*

# --- ...except the repository's own metadata -------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/REFINEMENTS.md
!/docs/

# --- Indicator: only the source of this application -----------------------
!/Indicators/
/Indicators/*
!/Indicators/Blood/
/Indicators/Blood/*
!/Indicators/Blood/LiquidityRange.mq5

# --- Expert Advisors: this application's folder only ----------------------
!/Experts/
/Experts/*
!/Experts/Blood/

# --- Shared modules: canonical MQL5 include tree --------------------------
!/Include/
/Include/*
!/Include/Blood/

# --- Build artefacts and local state (never tracked) ----------------------
*.ex5
*.ex4
*.mqproj
*.log
*.dat
